@startuml
title 异常自愈与熔断回滚时序图（Proma Core 对齐 v1.1）

participant "ProgrammingOrchestrator" as Prog
participant "AgentOrchestrator" as AO
participant "SandboxRuntime" as Sandbox
participant "GWTTestRunner" as Test
participant "SecurityScanner" as Security
participant "SnapshotManager" as Snapshot
participant "LocalFirstStore\nJSON/JSONL/files" as Store
participant "GuideAgentService" as Guide
participant "main/ipc.ts" as IPC
participant "preload/bridge.ts" as Bridge
participant "Jotai Agent Atoms" as Atoms
participant "WorkspaceShell" as UI
actor User as U

Prog -> Sandbox: run project
Sandbox --> Prog: execution error
Prog -> Store: appendJsonl(runtime error summary)
Prog -> IPC: emit AgentEvent(repairing)
IPC -> Bridge: push AgentEvent
Bridge -> Atoms: update atomFamily(sessionId)
Atoms -> UI: show repairing message
UI --> U: “正在尝试修复”

loop max 3 repair attempts
  Prog -> AO: query(sessionId, repair prompt)
  AO -> Store: appendJsonl(partial repair stream)
  AO --> Prog: repair instruction
  Prog -> Sandbox: apply fix and rerun
  Sandbox --> Prog: result
  alt success
    Prog -> Test: run regression
    Test --> Prog: result
    break
  end
end

alt 修复成功
  Prog -> Snapshot: create(kind=iteration, health=healthy)
  Snapshot -> Store: write snapshot metadata and files
  Prog -> IPC: emit AgentEvent(iteration_ready)
  IPC -> Bridge: push AgentEvent
  Bridge -> Atoms: update state
  Atoms -> UI: refresh preview
  UI --> U: 展示修复后预览
else 修复失败达到上限
  Prog -> Snapshot: rollback(latest healthy)
  Snapshot -> Store: restore files and append rollback record
  Snapshot --> Prog: rollback result
  Prog -> Guide: create rollback notice
  Guide --> IPC: user visible message
  IPC -> Bridge: push AgentEvent(rollback_done)
  Bridge -> Atoms: update state
  Atoms -> UI: render options
  UI --> U: “已经回到上一个正常版本”
  UI --> U: 继续尝试 / 接受当前 / 补充说明
end

alt 安全问题
  Prog -> Security: scan and repair independently
  Security --> Prog: security result
  Prog -> Store: appendJsonl(security event without sensitive payload)
  Prog -> Guide: create plain risk explanation if unresolved
end

AO -> AO: cleanup iterator and remove active session

@enduml
